<title>RUSSIA: Market value of Russian T-bills 223.70 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Market value of Russian T-bills 223.70 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The market value of Russian government securities in circulation fell to 223.70 trillion roubles on January 13 from 223.98 trillion on January 10, the central bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>							   Jan 13	Jan 10</p>
<p>(trillion roubles)</p>
<p>    Market value all government securities   223.70	223.98</p>
<p>    Nominal value				    241.61	241.61</p>
<p>(days)</p>
<p>    Weighted average outstanding maturity    143.68	146.70</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
